          "review_state": "unreviewed"
        },
        {
          "step_id": "prl_dcs_route",
          "text": "Afterwards, if anyone has joint pain, tingling, or itchy or blotchy skin, go back to the first screen of Someone needs help and choose Decompression sickness after a spacewalk.",
