        },
        {
          "step_id": "prl_spo2",
          "text": "Clip the oximeter on a finger, hand warm, relaxed and still, until it shows one steady number. A normal number does not cancel serious symptoms. The level that needs action: to be set by clinical review. Never delay or stop the depressurization response for this.",
          "text_first_time": null,
          "who": "any_crew",
          "needs": {
